11	- **iOS support** (`ios.py`): Frida MCP server for rootless jailbroken iOS (palera1n, `/var/jb/`). Uses `frida-compile` and `frida-objc-bridge`; precompiled Python 3.12 `.deb` and native wheels in `ios_precompiled/`.
