17	- **One-shot script execution (Android)**: Resolved futures on `agent:result` exposed a latent bug — `Java.perform({ onComplete, onError })` is incompatible with esbuild-bundled `frida-java-bridge`; switched to `Java.perform(function() { ... })`.
18	- **One-shot / agent flow (iOS)**: Same message-pipeline fixes so success vs error and console output surface correctly.
19	
20	### Notes
21	
22	- Android workflow unchanged in spirit: Termux, esbuild, manual Frida Python build.
23	- FastMCP remains pinned to **below 3.0** on both platforms until migration.
